.B :
to open the command window, then type a single character. Play-mode chars
.RB ( r / s / c )
set repeat/shuffle/cycle. Any other char below is forwarded to mpv as
.BR mpv_command_string .
Keys are aligned to mpv's native default
.I input.conf
where a native binding exists.
